  "known_limitations": [
    "The four PR #346 topic baselines are frozen at FROZEN_ELIGIBLE_ONLY: that PR recorded the retained denominator (68/27/38/11) in two independent artifacts, but never recorded TOTAL_SCANNED or the exclusion count for those topics. Those counters are marked unresolved and are never inferred.",
